# Flying a ship from its remote control with the thumbsticks: A raises the ship, the left stick pushes it forward, and
# holding Y lets go of the remote control. A remote control has no cockpit rig, so the thumbsticks fly it on their own.
# Needs the Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1 that Earth Planet ships near its starter base (powered, small grid, gears free).
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: name the ship's remote control, then take control of it the way the game's remote access does ------
admin creativeTools
# Earth Planet's ships belong to the world's own identity: the game lets the player control them once they own them
own Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
# remote control and cameras reach a ship only through its antenna, which this one has off
switch Drill Ship Antenna on
# the ship's cockpit is its main cockpit, and the game flies and parks a ship only from that one while it has one
property Cockpit on Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1 MainCockpit false
rename Remote Control on Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1 as Drill remote control
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
control Drill remote control
wait 2
read block Drill remote control
expect controlledByMe == true
expect log VR controls: ship controller (RemoteControl) within 5
head 0 1.6 0
wait 1

# ---- A raises the ship ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
mark
press right a
wait 3
release right a
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
expect position moved > 0.5

# ---- The left stick forward pushes it along (dampeners on, so it comes to rest after) ----------------------------
mark
stick left 0 1
wait 3
stick left 0 0
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
expect position moved > 0.5

# ---- B lowers it ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
mark
press right b
wait 3
release right b
read grid Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
expect position moved > 0.3

# ---- Hold Y: the remote control is let go and the character is on foot again ------------------------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 2
read block Drill remote control
expect controlledByMe == false
expect log VR controls: on foot within 5
